  "description": "The Nulane Pro FE's frame takes inspiration from our road, gravel and mountain bike series and adds a full accessory package into the mix. There's plenty of clearance for big, grippy and comfortable 45mm tyres, even with the included mudguards. We fitted an integrated seat clamp, then added our neat and sturdy Semi-Integrated Carrier 2.1, a lighting set and kickstand, and finished off with neat Internal Cable Routing. And the full carbon fork isn't just lightweight – it also helps reduce vibration from the road and features lowrider rack mounts. Wherever you're going, it's got everything that you need.",
